      "body": "",
      "button_link": "",
      "button_text": "",
      "description": "1.Business Sxope\nEstablished from 2008, after 16 years developing and growth, come up four production lines now.\n1.1 OEM & ODM for brand purchaser and distributors\n1.2 Residential and Hotel projects, motel to 5 star hotel, apartment, restaurant, club, bar, villa, etc.\n1.3 High end customizing famous international brand furniture for interior design company, market developing under the brand *Home Comry 住贝*\n1.4 Concrete furniture: market developing under the brand *Home Comfort X 金砼坊*, including GFRC + HPC two collection concrete manufacturing system products.\n \n2.Facilities\n2.1 **Furniture Factory** 9,500 sqm, including metal, wood, upholstery workshops, produce sofa, sofabed, chair,\nstool, ottoman, table, bed, night stand, cabinet, console, etc.\n2.2 **Concrete Products Factory** 3,000 sqm, produce concrete furniture.\n2.3**Showroomt 3,000 sqm, as international sales & service center. Exhibit our latest products and quality standard.\n \n3.Team Expertise\nOver than 80 skilled workers with an average of 16 years of furniture manufacturing experience, capable of meetingdiverse quality requirements from residential projects to 5-star hotels.\n \n4.R&D Capability\n150 new items a year, developing technique by *3D render* +\n*interior structure exploded view* + *1:1 structure template printing* + *3D\nprinting&scan\", our experienced engineers make the R&D efficient and perfect.\n5.Global Market\nAsia, North America, European, Australia, Middle East and so on. Serving wholesalers,  retailers,  brand owners, online distributors, and interior designers and so on.\n \n6.Production Capacity\nTurnover forecast for current year: around 250x40HC containers, abou 70% export globally.\n \n7.Core Values\nFocus on rigorous quality management and on-time service, aiming to exceedclient expectations and foster mutual growth.\n \n8.Certification\nISO9001, FSC, ISTA-6 FEDEX-B, BS EN 12520, EN16139, etc...",
